se, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4403d421ad7761df1200dedc9171a5c02482caf2", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of github.com:yielding/code", "created_at": "2026-02-22T17:08:32Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7dd16e62b83d9a5479a913ccd44ff481ec816615", "message": "Add OS detection to make.debug and make.release\n\n- Default compiler: clang++ on macOS, g++ on Linux\n- Replace nproc with sysctl -n hw.ncpu on macOS\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-22T17:06:30Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "977a09770945211b59e5d01df15c3cddb74c1386", "message": "Fix osx zshrc to match actual macOS environment\n\nUpdate OPENCV_HOME to Homebrew Apple Silicon path, remove nonexistent\nRUBYLIB path, and remove /usr/local/go/bin from PATH (Go via Homebrew).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:59:49Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "46eb39a07c7f474a08524402bdcb6f483d8729b0", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of github.com:yielding/code", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:54:28Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "33d4efe0216cf66568edd45dc401910ac2853e79", "message": "..", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:53:10Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b3ca29f32975c555e93a70aebbeff2f452f6362e", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of github.com:yielding/code", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:38:10Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bb8f70254f65d43eca4d4ea9e1af3e53ac8ed936", "message": "Separate zshrc per OS instead of common (revert merge)\n\nLinux and macOS zshrc have fundamentally different needs:\n- Linux: server settings (PFMW_TEMP, ORT_ROOT, LD_LIBRARY_PATH), gcc, tmux black auto-start\n- macOS: clang, homebrew shellenv, no tmux auto-start\n\nBoth now use $HOME instead of hardcoded /home/yielding.\nRestore backup/restore scripts to handle zshrc as OS-specific.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:36:46Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2cc460d57297be5deea3690192715b6ebe09507e", "message": "Move zshrc to common/ with OS detection for cross-platform support\n\n- Remove separate linux/dot.zshrc and osx/dot.zshrc (were identical)\n- Add uname-based branching: Darwin (clang, homebrew) vs Linux (gcc, LD_LIBRARY_PATH)\n- Remove hardcoded HOME=/home/yielding (system-provided)\n- Replace /home/yielding references with $HOME\n- Update backup/restore scripts to use common/dot.zshrc\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:30:15Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9eceb5e3f90c908648e2cf9eeaf91f3fbda8c980", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of github.com:yielding/code", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:16:38Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "22e913eb4246fb122af9bb65b982b633ea3a3d01", "message": "unified", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:16:12Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a7256178b0068b2b8b69d3ba0f4daa7098826d9c", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of github.com:yielding/code", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:09:27Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d2c8206158b739a4973d1e954761647a0ff6a5fc", "message": "Remove duplicate bin/cpp.rb (superseded by common/bin/cpp.rb)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:08:50Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1524c103daa50e664256c0281ac31fdc5cae721d", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of github.com:yielding/code", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:05:35Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "82aeb53906dfcf2ff1826f1024bcc6557a91184a", "message": "Remove unused ccls scripts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:05:06Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a7ba6a221166f2a6a77ef59f87739b724e44624c", "message": "Remove OS-specific hardcoding for cross-platform support\n\n- runebs.rb: replace /usr/local/bin/ absolute paths with bare command names\n- dot.tmux.conf: replace /home/yielding with ~ in sessionx-custom-paths\n- cpp.defualt/CMakeLists.txt: add if(APPLE)/elseif(UNIX) platform branching\n- cmake.snippets: add platform branching to init_clang, init_g++, init_simple\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-22T16:04:12Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "30b4e2e6797d132d39d1804cb99a6bbad3cdaa20", "message": "Add OS detection to nvim configs for cross-platform support\n\n- globals.lua: python3/ruby host paths per OS\n- lsp.lua: solargraph path per OS\n- dbee.lua: conditional FileSource on Linux only\n- obsidian.lua: vault path per OS\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-22T15:52:35Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "914dfd96a30b79b523ee2d98e5c51c8ab762dcf7", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of github.com:yielding/code", "created_at": "2026-02-22T14:02:41Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9d12d1897c79a1003627d580f1d2272c9f5c1be7", "message": "updated backup and restore logic", "created_at": "2026-02-22T14:01:55Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e6b17a6e8b57e814ad6eb35396a308975ecdac9b", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of github.com:yielding/code", "created_at": "2026-02-22T14:01:33Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e97a7eb865e38b51e5ef7fb3f88bb24f863d54fa", "message": ".", "created_at": "2026-02-22T14:01:14Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "230f233313c3c5c47e28244e5aba336d1b0c1586", "message": "Sync dotfiles: add OS detection to backup script, update configs\n\n- backup.dot.files now detects OS (Darwin/Linux) like restore script\n- Remove lazy-lock.json from backup/restore (auto-generated)\n- Update nvim, tmux, zsh, and other configs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-22T14:00:06Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "64293b90c09a8b077b23602e62cf6ca774dc9ebd", "message": "fixed", "created_at": "2026-02-22T13:39:57Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "958a4ca826d3184818c32c346b2aa8a3fcfdc85d", "message": "added more.", "created_at": "2026-02-22T13:18:14Z", "repo": "code", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5d935866152f3d7a3c00893cdfcec3ab1f09b3cf", "message": "Reorganize dotfiles into common/osx/linux structure\n\nSplit flat layout into OS-aware directories so restore works\ncorrectly on both macOS and Linux. common/ holds OS-independent\nfiles (nvim, bin, UltiSnips, gitconfig, ghci, tmux.conf),\nosx/ holds macOS-specific zshrc/aliases/themes, and linux/\nholds Linux-adapted versions with system paths instead of\nhomebrew. Also fix lazlock.json typo in restore script.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at